# Every text file is checked out with LF line ends on every platform. GitHub's Windows runners
# check out with core.autocrlf, which gave the sources, the GUI scripts and the committed reports
# CRLF there, and 17 of mp-gui's tests, which read them as text, failed only on Windows (CI run
# 37125541254, 2026-10-03). The project is written on Linux and its goldens carry LF; PowerShell
# reads the tools/win10 scripts as well with LF as with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Test fixtures and fuzz seeds are bytes, not text: a Windows checkout must not change a byte of
# them - the legacy firmware fixture grew from 654 to 664 bytes with CRLF in the tiny10 VM, and
# config-firmware.gui failed on its download size (2026-09-26) - and four seeds are CRLF on purpose.
testdata/** -text
crates/*/testdata/** -text
fuzz/seeds/** -text
